portao-3|GENERIC||None||Corporate payments and spend management for Latin America|fintech, no proof point|Corporate travel and supplier payments in Brazil hinge on tax-compliant invoicing for every transaction.
mito-health|GENERIC||None||At-cost lab testing marketplace with personalized test recommendations|consumer health marketplace, no proof point|Recommending which labs to skip requires clinical rules that hold up across ages and histories.
korrai|RAG|P2|Moderate|PHYS|Traceable AI workspace unifying geospatial, satellite and engineering data for site risk|traceable answers over geotechnical studies and engineering documents = retrieval -> P4|Site risk answers must cite the exact geotechnical report and satellite pass behind each failure mode.
yemaachi-biotechnology|GENERIC||None||Sequencing African cancer samples to improve diagnostics|genomics wet lab, no proof point|Building a diverse cancer knowledgebase depends on sample logistics and consistent sequencing across many sites.
posthog|GENERIC||None|AGENT_EVAL|All-in-one product analytics, replay, flags and experimentation platform|analytics platform; LLM observability is one module|Product analytics at PostHog scale is a query engine problem over billions of events per customer.
hubble|GENERIC||None||Open source BI built on dbt|BI tooling, no proof point|Keeping metric definitions consistent between dbt models and dashboards is the core semantic layer problem.
turion-space|GENERIC||None|PHYS|Spacecraft for space domain awareness imaging and in-orbit servicing|space hardware; imaging analysis is downstream|Space domain awareness imagery depends on tracking faint, fast-moving objects against a bright background.
insoma-bio|GENERIC||None||Regenerative product to help plastic surgeons rebuild fat|medical device and biomaterials, no proof point|Fat grafting outcomes depend on how much tissue survives, which is the variable regenerative scaffolds target.
spaceium-inc|GENERIC||None||Automated space stations that refuel and repair spacecraft|space hardware, no ML proof point|Zero-loss cryogenic transfer in orbit is the thermal engineering problem that decides refueling economics.
risotto|AGENT_EVAL||Moderate|RAG|AI agent that resolves IT helpdesk and access requests in chat|IT agents granting permissions need reliability guardrails -> P3|IT agents granting access need evals on real tickets, since one wrong permission grant is a security incident.
assembly|CODE||Moderate|GENERIC|AI app builder that creates client-facing business apps from plain language|AI app builder per current homepage = code generation agents -> P3 coding|Generated client apps need checks against auth and data permissions before a firm exposes them to clients.
trayd|GENERIC||None||Payroll and compliance platform for construction subcontractors|payroll SaaS, no proof point|Certified payroll for union and prevailing wage jobs means encoding rules that vary by project and locality.
spenmo|GENERIC||None||Accounts payable and spend management for Asian businesses|fintech, no proof point|Auto-categorizing spend across cards and transfers is where AP tools save finance teams the most time.
zingbus|GENERIC||None||Intercity bus aggregator in India|transport marketplace, no proof point|Dynamic pricing for intercity buses depends on demand forecasts per route and departure time.
moichor|PHYS||Moderate|GENERIC|AI microscopy analysis of animal blood and cytology samples|cell image classification across species = vision models -> P2|Blood cell morphology varies so much across species that one vision model needs species-aware calibration.
